    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59921" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κρητ-ίζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κρής</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>speak like a Cretan</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				D.Chr.
				[11.23]
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>play the Cretan</i>, i.e. <i>lie</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς Κρῆτας</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κρῆτα</span> K. 'diamond cut diamond', <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				8.18.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
